00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:02.440
Dream-coloured Magical Essence!

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:04.620
Entremets.

00:23:07.410 --> 00:23:12.870
Entremets are originally sweets served as the final dish for western cuisine course.

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:15.720
In Japan, it is called dessert.

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:20.620
There are two varieties - hot and cold.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:25.710
For cold sweets, there are jelly, sherbet, ice cream, mousse, etcetera.

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:31.020
For hot sweets, there are pudding, soufflé, crêpe, pie and etcetera.

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:38.990
In the world of French sweets, majority of the Whole Type cold cakes can also be considered together as Entrements.

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:45.330
In regard to a large number of Entrements, the smaller sweets are called petit gâteau.

00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:56.880
With regard to larger sweets that are placed in the showcase of a cake shop, all those smaller sweets are then called petit gâteau.

00:24:00.900 --> 00:24:03.150
The final day of the Cake Grand Prix finals.

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:04.890
We're going to win and go to Paris for sure!

00:24:04.890 --> 00:24:07.800
Andou-kun and Hanabusa-kun are finishing up nicely.

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:11.280
And then there's Kashino, concentrating on the hardest job of all.

00:24:11.280 --> 00:24:14.680
He's trying his best through lack of sleep, but it seems like he's wavering...

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:15.960
Is he okay?

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:19.330
